{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS1gznf429un7cCgGsDt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added all six events from `docs/EVENTS.md` to the registration and offers screens, sending each through `Analytics.capture`. I only ran `dart format`. I didn't run the analyzer or the app, because `flutter_lints` doesn't resolve without a `pub get`. Nothing was sent to PostHog.\n\n- **Email and phone started:** each fires once, on the first change in that field. Neither the email nor the phone number is sent as a property.\n- **`loan_amount_changed`:** fires when the user releases the slider, once per drag instead of on every frame. I did this to keep volume down on the PostHog free tier.\n- **`terms_accepted`:** fires only when the checkbox is ticked, not when it's unticked.\n- **`registration_continue_tapped`:** fires on Continue with `amount` and `terms`, just before navigating to the offers screen.\n- **`offers_scrolled`:** fires when a vertical scroll gesture ends, with the `offset`. If you want it only once per session for the funnel, that's a small change. I chose one per gesture because the spec says \"how far they scrolled\".\n\nI wrote the details in `ANSWER.md`. The code changes are in `lib/screens/registration_screen.dart` and `lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`. I haven't committed anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":514,"cache_read_input_tokens":24817,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":514},"output_tokens":430,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7e37cb01-d077-4bbc-bb2a-dea368721adb","uuid":"5f517279-4448-4175-b39f-e884e7b86422","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:13:50.829Z","request_id":"req_011CgS1gzZG6N2L